      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaac30a6a5bf6d7bf187b9c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "切",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecade35371c924e290eeb9e73dc6440e03acfd29007467ed2e348a0487ea080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3d6b38795a72dcfdf02312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed21a303e5d04ce20dc3019128d0a1b9543f7a003cdb9a3f9ece6e791dcf33a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb523e36b5effc213ea9659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的话能拿到这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ed09a19424c27de252da1fd21fab7a5f5c74b2d952b65640bb280236be5842",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de11f91c274333d5a6b5dea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……好像是累到了呢、\r\n，身体感觉好沉重……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fce54abc42182afea85022f07d34d6a44c8dc4a20f982b6a7f1a3c0b770a8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe9ce8c00d30d3e06c7b86cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练公……虽然很抱歉、\r\n但我似乎没能消解疲劳呢……\r\n稍微让我休息一下可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29546fc970c9e158a77d59f5acfc6b3c44c3393d8e9d8e71af6d5189759bf7cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2c5aea0d8e8e15d6dc7bb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲也好状态也罢全都非常好啊！\r\n不管是什么训练、\r\n我都会漂亮地完成的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c034cfd1fadb3d16f82ccc97702d81be34bda4802f76632a7f2ed70a4bd5c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d7b90d729642bb8f409201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哦哦哦哦！燃起来了啊！\r\n不管单挑对手是谁也好、\r\n我可都不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cfaaf95d1b5aca659d1053618bb6b8661baf117739ac4fae7453781c63c3d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6399bc912db252411554f2e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉能跑出不错的成绩呢！\r\n趁现在赶紧开始训练吧，训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "113e5b93e128eba0b011b4dac7d945a769181fe3d6f63940d00c2ecf3a258a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efafd9b66ef53e8574515eac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——、状态不错啊！\r\n那么就干劲十足地开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b976fc35b6f62865e8a48120582216c316d0ec7776fc9235a17cb3665aac03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90f55fb58f1efa989884624a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么、就好好加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ab120f05f975f12f932a760ba07a33cfab299be6a05cb80161d375ea406ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771f498dbb38471e5fd83bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始什么样的训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d35ddb8929d5e57da8aafaa5a3f3235e5bec9a2d55e13211d39259e0488a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb390302d2d0ab0a164faa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～……找不回平时的状态啊！\r\n因为要负责巡楼，所以睡得也比平时要晚了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad6bcd93dbc75bb1a35623dbb622c91f3fb7bf9ef474daebd3b18c998451e4f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1877ee7b8a9d691e4dd29e86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗好的衣服好像晾太久了啊……\r\n啊啊、不行！都没法集中精神了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8185f00d6f98397f7eba9ec15ff547db95e2df5bf8841ed84f7a7d10aa0f5f81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3d47d881ab8d8efc1a1de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲和状态都差的不行啊……\r\n真是的、我到底是怎么了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3cbb32e885e4d5f3c77edf5cdd102c3914eaa6a8441e4fc03b92878c3df0117",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5040b2f4c9407062e6f93a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶～……情绪一直都上不来啊。\r\n这种状态的话\r\n还怎么堂堂正正地单挑啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6db8f3c4b45b8df7870cfb672f12223f1212a121cef349720cda7bd0e6fc557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71b2e23ff04533ed6eebd46b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的赛程是不是安排的太密集了？\r\n虽然气势和根性什么的都很重要、\r\n但这些都是建立在身体健康的基础上的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3adf963a14ce6a532a52df543c64074d007dfb47d248e2c0dfc54f650445f270",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67bc3e4cec9e74749e2ee381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很不想这么说、但最近要参加的\r\n比赛也太多了吧？\r\n再这么下去的话、可就要搞坏身体了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b88dd6e276cecda14ac1e109339731b886843c2aa3613c8c2f9acde038045c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b1829d9f594a942bee9c81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲和状态都绝佳无比！\r\n你菱亚马逊姐认真起来的身姿、\r\n可要好好地刻在眼里哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a14d16502ca6f98e51f9ccafc3907c687b1467751770c2e3afd90da7a0e5713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ea451295ee2f7b3aeac2985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳！感觉能来场不错的单挑呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b94288a99c2024679bff1a4a7888addb8469fdbdef8725903ae4bddec69daa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8184dbe2bef05de584eeb3ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经做好万全准备了！可要瞧好了、\r\n我“女杰”的名号可不是浪得虚名的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78edd2c1421bd60aa776a5727af7ce17e8f3b91438883239c8abf18818490ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a5b1e9013132ba1fb9b5ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉身体很轻快啊！\r\n这样一来、就能跑出让自己满意的结果了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da7b76ef842b59096cb1566f257ef3acc1fe8f147341a45287463751fb029d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:705de76524d15243c1ddffa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲十足！无论对手是谁都放马过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5d6e0e65df6c3191a0e0167f20ae7e22eead98239564f7e9f0f5a7aa845aad4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e483ab69ab40e069a5b2a19c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体能够随心所欲的活动呢……\r\n好嘞！你就好好期待一下结果吧、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd652a8124f7c963781415dbf4ec0bada961b6b41aa3327a92f6deb84f6d1ed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5d97f7741ac5b9439dc733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉不错呢。\r\n这个状态的话、应该就能赢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a743a5f03b123e0de732515b3570a4af5b05e2ee186c369bde8b9641035a42b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e09c8f1477f603f1faf011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛的话只要全力以赴就行了。\r\n那样就肯定会能赢的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dcabaedff5510f49800aff2466d7f2e9e8e88b4096011bc077b24bfdad3cdd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "20030"
      ]
    }
  ]
